 17592186045417] [17592186323679 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "40f09dba-8d73-5062-813a-36456c356837" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186323679 #edb/ref 1074 "To find the $y$-intercepts, we plug $x=0$ and $z=0$ into the equation: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{0}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{(0-2)^{2}}{16} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{1}{4} & =1 \\\\ (y-1)^{2}-1 & =4 \\\\ (y-1)^{2} & =5 \\\\ y-1 & =\\pm \\sqrt{5} \\\\ y & =1\\pm \\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we get the solutions $y=1-\\sqrt{5}$ and $1+\\sqrt{5}.$\n\nTherefore, the intercepts with the $y$-axis are $(0,1-\\sqrt{5},0)$ and $(0,1+\\sqrt{5},0).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336215 #edb/ref 1080 "Two parallel lines: $y=2x\\pm 2$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336215 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336215 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1367a913-bd30-5d46-b192-55918d608fb8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336346 #edb/ref 1080 "An ellipse: $\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{8}=1$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336346 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336346 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "21b8d9e0-4b1f-50b9-9504-2d80b0e4177d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336852 #edb/ref 1080 "Two intersecting lines: $y=\\pm 2(x-2)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336852 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336852 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5a1cf904-9470-5d6d-bd73-91765fe6eab5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337468 #edb/ref 1080 "A hyperbola: $\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{8}=-1$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337468 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337468 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "9ef4b176-d408-5e50-bc9d-8a80f42c2948" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337960 #edb/ref 1080 "A hyperbola: $\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{8}=1$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337960 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337960 #edb/